<title>TURKEY: Turkey says more than 100 Kurd rebels killed.</title>
<headline>Turkey says more than 100 Kurd rebels killed.</headline>
<dateline>ANKARA 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turkish security forces killed 118 Kurdish guerrillas on Tuesday in clashes on the mountainous border with Iraq, the state-run Anatolian news agency said.</p>
<p>The agency said 11 members of the security forces had also died in the fighting, in the southeastern Turkish provinces of Sirnak and Hakkari.</p>
